{"id":"8b9f644fd1db0c549096cd6665f7490ac9dc6a65","axis":"silent","repo":"salvo-rs/salvo","sha":"8b9f644fd1db0c549096cd6665f7490ac9dc6a65","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","lines":["@@ -92,6 +92,8 @@ The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/).","   without replaying custom callbacks or overriding middleware response policies.","   When opaque filters prevent safely inferring any supported method, routing defaults","   to 404; service middleware can provide its own 405 status and `Allow` header.","+- Honor TUS method overrides during endpoint selection, before access-control","+  hoops and lifecycle hooks run, and reject malformed override headers."," - Reject malformed CSRF bcrypt proofs and costs that differ from the configured cost before","   verification, require bcrypt 0.19.2 or newer, and omit CSRF cipher keys from debug output."," - Honor explicit OIDC JWT algorithm allowlists and share a one-second JWKS refresh cooldown"],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/tus/README.md","lines":["@@ -60,6 +60,13 @@ The Concatenation extension is not implemented. Custom `DataStore` backends"," cannot enable it by returning `Extension::Concatenation`: it is omitted from"," `Tus-Extension`, and creation requests containing `Upload-Concat` are rejected."," ","+Clients unable to send PATCH or DELETE can use `X-HTTP-Method-Override`.","+The override is resolved during tus endpoint selection, before service and router","+hoops run. Hoops and lifecycle hooks see the effective method; use hoops for","+method-based authorization. Filters outside the tus router still see the wire","+method. Malformed or repeated override headers are rejected with 400; unknown","+methods receive 405. Requests outside the tus endpoints are unchanged.","+"," ## TUS Protocol Endpoints"," "," | Method | Path | Description |"],"additions":7,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/tus/src/handlers/delete.rs","lines":["@@ -1,10 +1,11 @@"," use std::sync::Arc;"," ","-use salvo_core::http::{HeaderValue, StatusCode};","+use salvo_core::http::{HeaderValue, Method, StatusCode};"," use salvo_core::{Depot, Request, Response, Router, handler};"," "," use crate::error::{ProtocolError, TusError};"," use crate::handlers::apply_common_headers;","+use crate::method_override::TusMethodFilter;"," use crate::stores::Extension;"," use crate::utils::check_tus_version;"," use crate::{CancellationContext, H_TUS_RESUMABLE, H_TUS_VERSION, TUS_VERSION, Tus};","@@ -73,5 +74,7 @@ async fn delete(req: &mut Request, depot: &mut Depot, res: &mut Response) {"," }"," "," pub(crate) fn delete_handler() -> Router {","-    Router::with_path(\"{id}\").delete(delete)","+    Router::with_path(\"{id}\")","+        .filter(TusMethodFilter(Method::DELETE))","+        .goal(delete)"," }"],"additions":5,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/tus/src/handlers/get.rs","lines":["@@ -1,10 +1,11 @@"," use std::sync::Arc;"," ","-use salvo_core::http::HeaderValue;","+use salvo_core::http::{HeaderValue, Method};"," use salvo_core::{Depot, Request, Response, Router, handler};"," "," use crate::error::{ProtocolError, TusError};"," use crate::handlers::{apply_common_headers, upload_expiration};","+use crate::method_override::TusMethodFilter;"," use crate::utils::check_tus_version;"," use crate::{CancellationContext, H_TUS_RESUMABLE, H_TUS_VERSION, TUS_VERSION, Tus};"," ","@@ -86,5 +87,7 @@ async fn get(req: &mut Request, depot: &mut Depot, res: &mut Response) {"," }"," "," pub(crate) fn get_handler() -> Router {","-    Router::with_path(\"{id}\").get(get)","+    Router::with_path(\"{id}\")","+        .filter(TusMethodFilter(Method::GET))","+        .goal(get)"," }"],"additions":5,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"crates/tus/src/handlers/head.rs","lines":["@@ -1,10 +1,11 @@"," use std::sync::Arc;"," ","-use salvo_core::http::{HeaderValue, StatusCode};","+use salvo_core::http::{HeaderValue, Method, StatusCode};"," use salvo_